title: 'Decided: a switch to a perspective that would draw the view as the root authors'' do is refused, and so is "next" where no other perspective would; a switch back never is.'
pid: 857028c8-d9c0-4cea-960c-e903c87b2874
body: |2-
  Switching would only plant a mode-line mark that means nothing. A
  view can lose every other perspective while switched (the graph
  changes, or editing a foreign root forks it and makes the clone the
  root), so the way back must stay open. A buffer of the diff view,
  which substitutes nothing, refuses every switch.
